  "interfaces": [
    "Private ReduceArtifactSpellCostsThisTurn(amount) and NextRedOrGreenCreatureFreeThisTurn instructions create source-independent rules for the resolving ability controller until finish_cleanup.",
    "The common definition-based spell reducer adds the captured artifact-only generic reduction; it never reduces colored or colorless symbols and remains shared by actual, scalar and funding paths.",
    "Only successful record_cast consumes every older matching next-cast grant. Paid qualifying casts, Plot and Warp consume it; probes, failed actions, plotting, and spell copies do not.",
    "Existing AnnounceFree retains independent ordinary hand/library/exile/graveyard permissions. New AnnounceFreeCounterGraveyard preserves the selected mandatory six-counter origin cost; a separate AnnounceFreeGraveyardPermanent retains Muldrotha source/type allowance. Neither creates timing or zone permission.",
    "Mandatory counter origin selection is owned by Announcement independently of the free mana alternative and uses the existing central additional-cost and counter-cost funder/executor.",
    "The new hand enumeration defers only to the legacy unrestricted hand alternative with the identical selected-face/surcharge availability check and nonland physical-front gate; no duplicate action is emitted."
  ],
